  "notes": "All 88 screen names come from the source's NAMES map and its 88 screen-state mappings (01-88, no gaps), verified by instantiating the inline component script for every screen. Groups follow the seven grouped wrapper pages exported with the source. Source is the v2-fixed export (SHA-256 ebe8ca7f...12e): Opening Balance screens 66 and 70-72 show required scope and a pending-contract boundary, screens 75-77 are Export Center handoff context, and the Supplier Payment allocation grid (20) lists only eligible outstanding payables. routeOrState and phaseLabel remain unset because the source does not assign them per screen. This package ships the real support.js (the genuine Claude Design dc-runtime, byte-identical to the Procurement, Customers and Cash copies); the renderer uses it directly."
